---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Card Night Support" description="Help and contact for Card Night, the card games app for iPhone and iPad.">
  <article class="wrapper">
    <h1>Card Night</h1>
    <p>Card Night puts ten classic card games in one app for iPhone and iPad: Klondike, Spider,
    FreeCell, Pyramid, TriPeaks, Golf, Hearts, Spades, Crazy Eights and War.</p>

    <h2>Support</h2>
    <p>Found a bug or have an idea? Email <a href="mailto:wesrog@gmail.com?subject=Card%20Night">wesrog@gmail.com</a>
    and include your device and iOS version.</p>

    <h2>Common questions</h2>
    <p><strong>How do I play online?</strong> Sign in to Game Center in the Settings app, then pick
    a table game and choose "Play online with friends". Empty seats are filled by the computer.</p>
    <p><strong>How do I learn the rules?</strong> Every game has a "How to play" button.</p>
    <p><strong>Why do I see ads?</strong> Card Night is free and supported by a small banner in the
    menu and an occasional ad between games. You can turn off personalized ads by declining
    tracking when asked, or later in Settings › Privacy &amp; Security › Tracking.</p>

    <p><a href="/cardnight/privacy">Privacy policy</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
